# AutomalityUI

AutomalityUI is a macOS 13+ Swift Package for the Automality design system: color, spacing, type tokens, hard-shadow buttons and boxes, pixel icons, progress navigation, deterministic dithered fills, and branded form controls.

## Local Package Dependency

In Xcode, add the package as a local dependency:

1. File > Add Package Dependencies.
2. Choose Add Local.
3. Select the `AutomalityUI` folder.
4. Add the `AutomalityUI` library to your app target.

Or in another Swift package:

```swift
.package(path: "../AutomalityUI")
```

Then add `"AutomalityUI"` to the target dependencies.

## Fonts

The type tokens request Space Mono, Inter, and JetBrains Mono by name. If those fonts are not registered by the host app or system, AutomalityUI falls back to `.monospacedSystemFont` for display, label, and data text, and `.systemFont` for body text.

## Usage

```swift
import SwiftUI
import AutomalityUI

struct ExampleView: View {
    enum ExportFormat: String, CaseIterable, Identifiable, Hashable {
        case png = "PNG"
        case jpeg = "JPEG"

        var id: Self { self }
    }

    @State private var step = 1
    @State private var format = ExportFormat.png
    @State private var filename = "watermarked"
    @State private var optimizeForWeb = true
    @State private var opacity = 72.0

    var body: some View {
        VStack(alignment: .leading, spacing: AutomalitySpacing.sm) {
            Text("Automality")
                .font(AutomalityType.display())
                .foregroundStyle(AutomalityColor.ink)

            Button("Choose Folder") {}
                .buttonStyle(.automalityPrimary)

            Button("Cancel") {}
                .buttonStyle(.automalitySecondary)

            AutomalitySectionBox("Input") {
                HStack {
                    PixelIcon(.folder, tint: AutomalityColor.teal)
                        .frame(width: 24, height: 24)
                    Text("Select source images")
                        .font(AutomalityType.body())
                }
            }

            AutomalityProgressNav(
                steps: ["Choose", "Watermark", "Export"],
                currentStep: $step
            )

            AutomalitySegmentedControl(selection: $format)

            TextField("Filename", text: $filename)
                .textFieldStyle(.automality)

            TextField("Opacity", value: $opacity, format: .number)
                .textFieldStyle(.automalityData)

            Toggle("Optimize for Web", isOn: $optimizeForWeb)
                .toggleStyle(.automality)

            AutomalitySlider(value: $opacity, in: 0...100)

            DitheredGradient(startHex: 0x083E48, endHex: 0x0D6B7E)
                .frame(height: 64)
        }
        .padding(AutomalitySpacing.md)
        .background(AutomalityColor.offWhite)
    }
}
```

